---
warning[W0510]: tenure lies on the path training → tenure → productivity (line 10)
  = help: adjusting for a mediator removes part of the effect of training; drop tenure to estimate the total effect
warning[W0511]: no sufficient adjustment set exists: ability is latent and confounds training and productivity (line 10)
  = help: consider an instrument for training, or a front-door design
warning[W0511]: the regressors leave the back-door path tenure ← training → productivity open (line 12)
  = help: 1 more back-door path is open
  = help: { training } is a sufficient adjustment set; `adjustment_sets` lists every one
warning[W0511]: the regressors leave the back-door path training ← tenure → productivity open (line 20)
  = help: 2 more back-door paths are open
  = help: { age, tenure } is a sufficient adjustment set; `adjustment_sets` lists every one
warning[W0511]: adjusting for tenure closes the path training ← tenure → productivity and opens the path training ← age → tenure ← region → productivity (line 21)
  = help: { age, tenure } is a sufficient adjustment set; `adjustment_sets` lists every one
warning[W0511]: no sufficient adjustment set exists: ability is latent and confounds training and productivity (line 24)
  = help: consider an instrument for training, or a front-door design
